[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Across the Channel]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.90]What is Debbie going to try to do? | 黛比打算做什么？
[00:14.66]Debbie Hart is going to swim | 黛比·哈特准备明天
[00:16.98]across the English Channel tomorrow. | 横渡英吉利海峡。
[00:20.41]She is going to set out from the French coast | 她打算早上5点钟
[00:23.60]at five o'clock in the morning. | 从法国海岸出发。
[00:26.60]Debbie is only eleven years old | 黛比只有11岁，
[00:29.70]and she hopes to set up a new world record. | 她希望创一项新的世界纪录。
[00:33.42]She is a strong swimmer and many people feel | 她是一个游泳能手，很多人认为
[00:36.81]that she is sure to succeed. | 她一定能成功。
[00:40.07]Debbie's father will set out with her | 黛比的父亲将乘一条小船
[00:42.85]in a small boat. | 同她一道出发。
[00:44.91]Mr. Hart has trained his daughter for years. | 哈特先生训练她的女儿已经多年了。
[00:49.16]Tomorrow he will be watching her anxiously | 明天他将焦急地注视着女儿
[00:52.66]as she swims the long distance to England. | 游过这段漫长的距离到达英国。
[00:56.89]Debbie intends to take short rests every two hours. | 黛比计划每两小时休息一下。
[01:01.68]She will have something to drink | 她将喝些饮料，
[01:03.59]but she will not eat any solid food. | 但不吃固体食物。
[01:07.63]Most of Debbie's school friends will be | 黛比的大多数同学
[01:10.18]waiting for her on the English coast. | 将在英国海岸等候她。
[01:13.30]Among them will be Debbie's mother, | 他们当中还有黛比的母亲，
[01:16.33]who swam the Channel herself | 她本人还是个姑娘时，
[01:18.40]when she was a girl. | 也曾横渡过英吉利海峡！
